{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01677wF4B4SY1J5nth8b4HEA", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leon_Botstein\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.clevelandjewishnews.com/jta/leon-botstein-bard-college-s-pioneering-jewish-president-to-retire-amid-jeffrey-epstein-ties/article_102a04a8-d220-531d-a038-7945c44bcff6.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.goucher.edu/news/leon-botstein-126th-commencement-speaker\"}, {\"url\": \"https://finchannel.com/?p=126093\"}, {\"url\": \"https://apicciano.commons.gc.cuny.edu/page/15/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://blogs.goucher.edu/intheloop/?p=9849\"}, {\"url\": \"https://finchannel.com/leon-botsteins-five-decade-transformation-at-bard-college/126093/people/2025/05/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ijn.com/?p=535232\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.newsitem.com/ap/national/bard-colleges-president-to-retire-after-scrutiny-of-relationship-with-jeffrey-epstein/article_62147d90-2e77-5f78-a8ec-4b19f989347d.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.dailygazette.com/hv360/hudson-bard-epstein/article_cda68c84-d2a7-4a8d-b686-eae0cec5c9d4.html\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:02:01.280Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Botstein \"longest-serving\" college president Bard", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01TB9u4d1SPfzsT1NpBaRxs5", "content": [{"title": "Leon Botstein", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leon_Botstein"}, {"title": "article 102a04a8 d220 531d a038 7945c44bcff6", "url": "https://www.clevelandjewishnews.com/jta/leon-botstein-bard-college-s-pioneering-jewish-president-to-retire-amid-jeffrey-epstein-ties/article_102a04a8-d220-531d-a038-7945c44bcff6.html"}, {"title": "Goucher College to Welcome Leon Botstein as 126th Commencement Speaker", "url": "https://www.goucher.edu/news/leon-botstein-126th-commencement-speaker"}, {"title": "• Facebook", "url": "https://finchannel.com/?p=126093"}, {"title": "apicciano.commons.gc.cuny.edu", "url": "https://apicciano.commons.gc.cuny.edu/page/15/"}, {"title": "Goucher College to Welcome Leon Botstein as 126th Commencement Speaker", "url": "https://blogs.goucher.edu/intheloop/?p=9849"}, {"title": "• Facebook", "url": "https://finchannel.com/leon-botsteins-five-decade-transformation-at-bard-college/126093/people/2025/05/"}, {"title": "By Shira Li Bartov", "url": "https://www.ijn.com/?p=535232"}, {"title": "Bard College's president to retire after scrutiny of relationship with Jeffrey Epstein", "url": "https://www.newsitem.com/ap/national/bard-colleges-president-to-retire-after-scrutiny-of-relationship-with-jeffrey-epstein/article_62147d90-2e77-5f78-a8ec-4b19f989347d.html"}, {"title": "Bard College's president to retire after scrutiny of relationship with Jeffrey Epstein (copy)", "url": "https://www.dailygazette.com/hv360/hudson-bard-epstein/article_cda68c84-d2a7-4a8d-b686-eae0cec5c9d4.html"}]}, "Leon Botstein is widely described as one of the longest-serving college presidents in U.S. history. He led Bard from 1975 until his retirement, which took effect in mid-2026.\n\n- **Tenure:** Sources put his time at Bard at roughly 50 to 51 years. One report notes capping a 51-year stint at the helm of the institution, while AP described him as president of the small, liberal arts college for a half century.\n- **Start:** He took over at 28 or 29, which made him one of the youngest college presidents in the country at that time. At just 28 years old, Botstein was one of the youngest college presidents in American history.\n- **Retirement:** The board announced his exit alongside an investigation into his ties to Jeffrey Epstein. The investigation found that nothing that President Botstein did in connection with his relationship with Jeffrey Epstein was illegal, but the board said his decisions reflect on his leadership of Bard. Another source says the law firm concluded he \"minimized and was not fully accurate in describing his relationship with Epstein.\"\n- **Later changes:** According to Wikipedia, in October 2026, he resigned from his remaining roles at Bard College. The sources I found don't include independent confirmation of that October resignation, so treat it as less certain than the rest."], "durationSeconds": 5.747633750000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01677wF4B4SY1J5nth8b4HEA", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXtK9U4Fyh2RvSwwAfn", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：Leon Botstein**\n\n- Hannah Arendt 葬在纽约州 Annandale-on-Hudson 的 Bard College 墓地，和丈夫 Heinrich Blücher 葬在一起。\n- Botstein 1975 年就任 Bard College 校长，2020 年时已经当了约 45 年，那时还在任。2026 年 6 月他从校长位置上退休，在任大约 51 年。\n- 我找到的资料都写他是美国任期最长的大学校长之一。没有哪个来源直接写“他是 Bard 任期最长的校长”，这一点是我推断的：Bard 历任校长里，没有别人的任期接近 45 年。\n\n我搜了 3 次。\n\nSources:\n- [Hannah Arendt 墓（Find a Grave）](https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/2968)\n- [Walk to Hannah Arendt's grave（Bard HAC）](https://hac.bard.edu/walk-to-hannah-arendts-grave)\n- [Roth and Arendt together for eternity（Bard HAC）](https://hac.bard.edu/amor-mundi/roth-and-arendt-together-for-eternity-2018-05-27)\n- [Leon Botstein（Wikipedia）](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leon_Botstein)\n- [AP：Bard College's president to retire（Daily Gazette）](https://www.dailygazette.com/hv360/hudson-bard-epstein/article_cda68c84-d2a7-4a8d-b686-eae0cec5c9d4.html)\n- [Cleveland Jewish News / JTA](https://www.clevelandjewishnews.com/jta/leon-botstein-bard-college-s-pioneering-jewish-president-to-retire-amid-jeffrey-epstein-ties/article_102a04a8-d220-531d-a038-7945c44bcff6.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1321, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6323, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1321}, "output_tokens": 653, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:02:07.824Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXtJs6Npr4cYoX89Zuf"}
